  "// overrides": "jsdom is aliased via \"$jsdom\" (track the devDep), NOT hard-pinned — a fixed jsdom version (and its transitive pins below) propagates through bun overrides onto the Playwright + chrome-devtools MCP browser stacks and breaks them. Do not re-pin jsdom.",
